.png" alt="事实核验与 Fact ID"><strong>事实核验与 Fact ID</strong><small>主张、图片、来源一一回链</small></button><button class="function-map-card is-featured" data-go="11"><span>08</span><img src="/static/showcase-assets/evidence-judge.png" alt="双轨审核与风险分流"><strong>双轨审核与风险分流</strong><small>自动修订与人工裁定各走各的路径</small></button></div></div><div class="function-map-band"><div class="function-map-band-intro"><span>03</span><b>可交付闭环</b><small>把内容交到平台和门店，继续沉淀下一次工作的上下文。</small></div><div class="function-map-cards"><button class="function-map-card" data-go="12"><span>09</span><img src="/static/gallery/showcase-moments-preview.png?v=20261025-0800" alt="多平台原生预览"><strong>多平台原生预览</strong><small>小红书、公众号、朋友圈、海报分别组织</small></button><button class="function-map-card" data-go="13"><span>10</span><img src="/static/showcase-assets/export-offline.png" alt="快捷打磨与离线导出"><strong>快捷打磨与离线导出</strong><small>定向修订、复制正文、导出 HTML</small></button><button class="function-map-card" data-go="14"><span>11</span><img src="/static/showcase-assets/store-final.png" alt="我的门店与私域触点"><strong>我的门店与私域触点</strong><small>企微、社群、到店邀约形成经营看板</small></button><button class="function-map-card" data-go="15"><span>12</span><img src="/static/showcase-assets/judge-final.png" alt="历史稿件与复盘"><strong>历史稿件与复盘</strong><small>跨稿避重、审核状态、后续动作可追踪</small></button></div></div></div><p class="speaker-note"><span>现场说</span>“这一段开始，我不再按平台讲案例，而是按业务能力讲：店长每遇到一个问题，系统就有一个明确的功能接住它。”</p></section>
